('111.6.b.9.B',4,'A dot plot shows the lengths of pencils in inches. Each dot is one pencil: 5 dots at 1/4, 4 dots at 1/2, 3 dots at 3/4, 1 dot at 1. How many pencils are longer than 3/4 inch?','["4", "6", "1", "2"]'::jsonb,2,'Add the dots to the right of 3/4: 1.','original'),
('111.6.b.9.B',4,'A dot plot shows the lengths of pencils in inches. Each dot is one pencil: 1 dot at 1/4, 2 dots at 1/2, 1 dot at 3/4, 2 dots at 1. How many pencils are longer than 3/4 inch?','["1", "6", "3", "2"]'::jsonb,3,'Add the dots to the right of 3/4: 2.','original'),
('111.6.b.9.B',3,'A frequency table shows: apples 9, pears 17, grapes 16, plums 10. How many are in grapes and apples together?','["25", "52", "7", "26"]'::jsonb,0,'16 + 9 = 25.','original'),
