('111.6.b.6.D',3,'Which quadrilateral always has 4 right angles?','["trapezoid", "rectangle", "rhombus", "parallelogram"]'::jsonb,1,'A rectangle has 4 right angles. A rhombus, trapezoid, or parallelogram does not always have any.','original'),
